# interceptor.px (v2) - fast side-entry craft (Area 3), aggressive alien machinery pass
# canvas 20x20, 2 frames (exhaust flicker, loop). Nose straight DOWN; silhouette symmetric about the vertical
# axis (the engine rotates it to face its velocity).
# needle spear fuselage built from segmented carapace plates (seams at rows 5 and 8), two back-swept blade
# wings ending in hooked spikes at the top corners, two short pincer mandibles hooking in around the needle
# nose. Angry eye pair: two red eyes under a dark brow plate on the head. Exhaust slot at the rear (top).
# light: top-left (left blade and plates lit e/d, right side c/b/a; plate tops lit below each seam).
# smallest must-read feature: the red eye pair (each eye 2x2: lit r over shaded n).
# anchor: frame centre (10,10).
# timing: 67 ms each (4 ticks). Only the 2 exhaust pixels change (O <-> Q).
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
a #1b2622  olive-0
b #31443a  olive-1
c #4f6852  olive-2
d #7e9a78  olive-3
e #b9cfa2  olive-4
n #92203a  red-1
r #da3d4f  red-2
O #ec7424  fire-2
Q #ffb347  fire-3
ramp olive a b c d e
ramp red n r
ramp fire O Q
frame a 67
